# Deployed by hyperi-developer (developer-rust role). Edits are overwritten.
# Read by hyperi-rust-govern at the start of every governed invocation.
#
# Written as a DEFAULT rather than an assignment, and that is a property to
# keep: the shim sources this file BEFORE reading its variables, so a plain
# assignment here would silently beat anything the caller exported, leaving no
# way to tune one invocation from the shell and no way to test the shim against
# a real deployed config.
#
# sccache cannot cache an incremental rustc call, and cargo's dev profile turns
# incremental on by default.
HYPERI_RUST_GOVERN_NO_INCREMENTAL="${HYPERI_RUST_GOVERN_NO_INCREMENTAL:-{{ '1' if rust_governor_no_incremental | bool else '0' }}}"
